; Zorro (1985, Datasoft) - disassembly
; Generated by tools/disasm.py from the original XEX; names and comments are
; in tools/symbols.py. Assembles back to the original file byte for byte:
;   mads zorro.asm -o:zorro.xex      (see build.sh)
;
; File layout (the same as the original):
;   $8000        chunk copier (INIT after each chunk below)
;   6 x $4000    data copied into the RAM under the OS ROM
;   $1480        the program, moved to $0480 by the RUN stub
;   $5BE8        sound driver, sprites and more data (runs where it loads)
;   $5000        RUN stub: move $1480-$4D7F to $0480, JMP Start

